WEBVTT

00:00:00.013 --> 00:00:04.617
Percent of total is a good example of why window functions are useful.

00:00:04.617 --> 00:00:10.612
Suppose total sales are one thousand dollars and one sale is two hundred dollars.

00:00:10.612 --> 00:00:14.477
That sale represents twenty percent of the total.

00:00:14.477 --> 00:00:22.977
A window calculation can place the overall total beside every sale row, so each row can calculate its own percentage

00:00:22.977 --> 00:00:25.752
without collapsing the detail records.

00:00:25.752 --> 00:00:31.532
This pattern works for percent of company revenue, percent of department activity,

00:00:31.532 --> 00:00:34.482
or percent of patient visits within a category.
